# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file the context ships node_modules/ and every bin/ and obj/ in the repo — hundreds
# of megabytes, sent to the daemon on every build. Worse than slow: a host-built obj/ carries
# absolute Windows paths and NuGet asset files that make a Linux restore inside the image fail in
# ways that read as unrelated compile errors.

.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.aspire/

# .NET build output — regenerated inside the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/
TestResults/
**/*.trx

# Dashboard — node_modules is reinstalled from package-lock.json by `npm ci`, and dist/ is rebuilt.
**/node_modules/
src/RaceIntelligence.Dashboard/dist/
src/RaceIntelligence.Dashboard/.tanstack/
src/RaceIntelligence.Dashboard/.nitro/
**/.vite/

# Derived entirely from the sources it indexes, and megabytes of it.
graphify-out/

# Secrets must reach a container through the environment, never baked into an image layer.
.env
*.env
.env.*
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/secrets.json

# Nothing in the test tree is needed to build a runtime image.
tests/

# Local-only inner loop: the Aspire graph is explicitly not the deployed topology.
src/RaceIntelligence.AppHost/

# Docs, plans and large capture fixtures.
docs/
*.md
!README.md
**/*.telemetry.bin
